# Pause menu override feature
#
# Custom patch for the vendored Luanti engine (see engine/README.md).
#
# Adds core.register_on_pause_menu() and lets a game ship
# menu/pause_menu.lua to override the in-game pause menu formspec.
#
# Generated against vanilla Luanti 5.16.1. Paths are relative to the
# repository root (apply with: git apply engine/patches/pause_menu.patch)
#
# Re-generate:
#   git clone --depth 1 --branch 5.16.1 https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti VANILLA
#   git diff --no-index VANILLA engine/luanti > engine/patches/pause_menu.patch

