 * `core.set_topleft_text(text)`
 * `core.show_touchscreen_layout()`
+* `core.register_on_pause_menu(function())`
+  * Register a function that overrides the in-game pause menu formspec.
+  * The function is called every time the pause menu is opened and must return a
+    formspec string.
+  * The default pause menu is shown instead if no callback is registered or it
+    returns an empty string.
+  * Note: this only works in singleplayer and locally-hosted games, because the
+    game's files are not available on the client otherwise.
